rooms_desc ({"You enter into the hall of Wesley's house and find yourself quite impressedwith how he has set everything up. You see a sideboard and upon it areletters, most of which are overdue bills waiting to be paid. Wesley is a student....You also see a crystal chandelier hanging down from the ceiling and thelight glares into your eyes, making you squint. A single framed picture ofShizuka Kudo hangs on the wall above the sideboard. You notice that it isfrom her latest album cover.There is an exit leading to a room north.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
